# Trial-Size Trial by Fire (outlands 15): the battlefield's scroll arm with the Scroll of Instant Warp already held. A
# SMN of level 20 with this quest accepted, the Mini Tuning Fork of Fire and a Scroll of Instant Warp: the fork's
# trade to FP_Entrance, option 17 (index 1, arena 1), IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-18 killed; 32001's finish: Ifrit learned
# (IFRIT_UNLOCKED 0, 0, 0), the scroll held: none given, Windurst fame +20, completed.
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByFire accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfFire
item ScrollOfInstantWarp
login
trade FP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfFire x1 # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-18                   # won, 32001 opens
finish                                    # Ifrit learned; the scroll held: none given; Windurst fame +20; completed
